          "quote": "Thus, the major deformation mechanisms in 11W consist of shearing of the c0 precipitates by pairs of 1/2 h110 i dislocations at tem- peratures up to the peak and bypassing of the precipitates by unpaired 1/2 h110 i dislocations above the peak.",
